# dexMonitor — Offers Endpoints

### Live Offers (REST)
# Returns array of currently live offers with cost breakdown
# Fields: id, exchange, direction, price, price_diff_percent, ref_price,
#         trade_cost_percent, net_premium_percent, cost_breakdown{...},
#         btc_min, btc_max, fiat_min, fiat_max, payment_method,
#         offer_id, first_seen, last_seen, is_live
GET {{base_url}}/api/live_offers

###

### Past Offers — last 24h, up to 1000
# Default: limit=1000, hours=24
GET {{base_url}}/api/past_offers

###

### Past Offers — custom window
# Adjust limit and hours as needed
GET {{base_url}}/api/past_offers?limit=100&hours=48
